<title>GERMANY: German insolvencies little changed in March.</title>
<headline>German insolvencies little changed in March.</headline>
<dateline>SVC    WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal</p>
<p>Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INSOLVENCIES    March 97	  Jan-March 97</p>
<p> Total insolvencies		2,660		   7,904</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   -0.1		    +4.6</p>
<p> Company insolvencies	    2,193		   6,437</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +1.8		    +5.7</p>
<p>W.GERMAN INSOLVENCIES</p>
<p> Total insolvencies		1,957		   5,865</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   -0.8		    +5.2</p>
<p> Company insolvencies	    1,573		   4,642</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +1.4		    +6.9</p>
<p>E.GERMAN INSOLVENCIES</p>
<p> Total insolvencies		  703		   2,039</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +1.9		    +2.9</p>
<p> Company insolvencies		620		   1,795</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		   +3.0		    +2.8</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
